DIAGNOSTIC ONLY — NOT FOR PRODUCTION. Never apply this to a GOROOT or a release toolchain.

A two-hunk change to the Go 1.24.7 runtime (src/runtime/os_wasm.go, src/runtime/mem_wasm.go),
used solely to confirm the cause of the wasi_snapshot_preview1 adapter trap (see ../../README.md,
"Follow-up 2"). ../run.sh step 7 applies it to copies of those two files in a scratch directory and
builds with `go build -overlay`, so the installed toolchain is never modified.

